---
// Frame 1: El Gancho Regional (Hero)
---

<div class="text-center space-y-8 py-12">
  <!-- Animated headline -->
  <div class="space-y-4">
    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white leading-tight">
      La gestión RAEE que la macrozona norte
      <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-400 via-orange-400 to-orange-500 bg-clip-text text-transparent">
        ya necesita
      </span>
    </h1>
    
    <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl text-slate-300 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      Calcula tu impacto y obtén tu hoja de ruta para la Ley REP en menos de 1 minuto.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- CTA Button with glow effect -->
  <div class="pt-8 flex justify-center">
    <button
      onclick="window.navigateFrame(2)"
      class="
        px-8 py-4 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-500 
        text-white font-bold text-lg rounded-full
        hover:shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(251,146,60,0.6)] 
        active:scale-95
        transition-all duration-300
        border border-amber-400/50
        group relative overflow-hidden
      "
    >
      <span class="relative z-10 flex items-center gap-2">
        <span>Iniciar Simulación</span>
        <svg class="w-5 h-5 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 7l5 5m0 0l-5 5m5-5H6" />
        </svg>
      </span>
      
      <!-- Animated background pulse -->
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-400 to-orange-400 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-30 transition-opacity" />
    </button>
  </div>

  <!-- Trust indicators -->
  <div class="pt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4 text-sm text-slate-400">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
      <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-green-400" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
        <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
      </svg>
      <span>100% Gratuito</span>
    </div>
    <div class="hidden sm:block text-slate-600">•</div>
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
      <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-green-400" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
        <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
      </svg>
      <span>Sin compromisos</span>
    </div>
    <div class="hidden sm:block text-slate-600">•</div>
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
      <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-green-400" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
        <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
      </svg>
      <span>< 1 minuto</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  button {
    box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(251, 146, 60, 0.3);
  }
</style>
